  partName: Stud (4)
  description: The Stud (4) is a tiny, complex fastener positioned at the top-center-front
    of the engine, serving as a threaded anchor point for various engine components.
    Composed of Material.001, this stud provides a strong and durable connection,
    withstanding significant stress and vibration. Notably, its complex shape enables
    it to be used in a variety of applications, from securing engine mounts to holding
    sensors and other components in place.
